This repository builds the dflow CLI and the dflow-server API. Other images
the chart runs are pinned by digest to their upstream registries.

Application workloads are deployed with charts derived from the upstream
application charts (application 0.1.26, the Gateway API variant 0.1.26, and
the stateful variant 0.1.24). The rebranded archives are in
packages/helm-chart/app-charts and are copied into the server image.
